From: dArkOS RG52 Mini port
Subject: The screens swap once per press of L3

Adapted for ROCKNIX: the swap stays on the RetroPad's L3, which RetroArch
maps for each device, instead of the RG52 Mini's Back key read from its
event device. The "Screen Swap Mode" option is gone: each press swaps.

